diagnostics/float-methods.em:5:5: Float has no method `unknown`
  1.0.unknown()
      ^^^^^^^
A Float has `abs`, `clamp`, `between?`, `zero?`, `positive?`, `negative?`, `floor`, `ceil`, `round`, `round_to`, `truncate`, `finite?`, `infinite?`, `nan?`, `to_int`, `to_string`, and `format`.
diagnostics/float-methods.em:6:11: `finite?` is a method, so it needs parentheses
